WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.446
Weglot is a website translation
service that translates rendered

2
00:00:04.446 --> 00:00:06.094
pages through plugins,

3
00:00:06.094 --> 00:00:07.939
a snippet, or a proxy.

4
00:00:08.339 --> 00:00:12.378
Weglot 2.0 adds JSON
translation workflows in GitHub.

5
00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:15.693
General Translation
combines source code,

6
00:00:15.693 --> 00:00:18.757
context, review, and locale routing.

7
00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:23.668
You wrap copy in &lt;T&gt;, and a
Context Group shares terms across

8
00:00:23.668 --> 00:00:24.375
projects.

9
00:00:24.775 --> 00:00:28.003
Its middleware serves each
language from your app at its own

10
00:00:28.003 --> 00:00:28.721
URL.

11
00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:34.827
Then npx gt translate in CI
translates only content whose source

12
00:00:34.827 --> 00:00:35.453
changed.

13
00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:38.634
Your team now ships
German with each release.
